description=Enables USB-PD/PPS negotiation for Motorola Edge 50 Pro (eqe) with 125W TurboPower & 68W PD/PPS support. Forces PPS voltage/current negotiation, disables charging throttles, adds thermal tuning at 44°C throttle/40°C resume, optimizes for custom ROMs.
